{"id":"vd-b1-fog-on-the-mountain","level":"b1","n":1,"title":{"en":"Stay Calm. Help Is on the Way.","vi":"Bình tĩnh. Cứu hộ đang đến."},"summary":"Giữa màn sương lạnh buốt, Nadia trấn an Tom vừa bị ngã, kiểm tra vết thương và giữ cho bạn tỉnh táo trong lúc chờ đội cứu hộ.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-fog-on-the-mountain","level":"b1","title":{"en":"Fog on the Mountain","vi":"Sương mù trên núi"}},"scene":{"background":"mountain-night","props":[]},"cast":{"tom":{"name":{"en":"Tom","vi":"Tom"},"look":"teenboy","x":560,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#B5652E","outfit":"jacket","top":"#C0392B","topShade":"#A93226"}},"nadia":{"name":{"en":"Nadia","vi":"Nadia"},"look":"woman","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#C68E6A","skinShade":"#AD7654","outfit":"jacket","top":"#2E86AB","topShade":"#246E8D"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"tom","en":"Ow! My ankle! I think I've broken it!","vi":"Ối! Mắt cá chân tớ! Tớ nghĩ tớ gãy chân rồi!","ipa":["oʊ","maɪ","ˈæŋkəl","aɪ","θɪŋk","aɪv","ˈbɹoʊkən","ɪt"],"start":0.554,"end":4.924,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.803],[2,2.116],[3,3.626],[4,3.821],[5,4.121],[6,4.316],[7,4.72]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Tom, stay calm. Don't move. Let me have a look.","vi":"Tom, bình tĩnh. Đừng cử động. Để tớ xem nào.","ipa":["tɑm","steɪ","kɑm","doʊnt","muv","lɛt","mi","hæv","ə","lʊk"],"start":5.714,"end":10.804,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,5.714],[1,6.264],[2,6.564],[3,7.972],[4,8.284],[5,9.717],[6,9.99],[7,10.133],[8,10.329],[9,10.394]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"It really hurts, Nadia.","vi":"Đau lắm, Nadia ơi.","ipa":["ɪt","ˈɹɪli","hɝts","ˈnædjə"],"start":11.594,"end":13.424,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,11.594],[1,11.727],[2,12.079],[3,12.834]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I know. Can you move your toes?","vi":"Tớ biết. Cậu cử động ngón chân được không?","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","kæn","ju","muv","jɔɹ","toʊz"],"start":14.214,"end":16.984,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,14.214],[1,14.269],[2,15.665],[3,15.912],[4,16.042],[5,16.29],[6,16.42]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes… a little.","vi":"Được… một chút.","ipa":["jɛs","ə","ˈlɪtəl"],"start":17.774,"end":18.944,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,17.774],[1,18.467],[2,18.519]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Good. That's a good sign. Does it hurt when I touch here?","vi":"Tốt. Đó là dấu hiệu tốt. Tớ chạm vào đây có đau không?","ipa":["ɡʊd","ðæts","ə","ɡʊd","saɪn","dʌz","ɪt","hɝt","wɛn","aɪ","tʌtʃ","hiɹ"],"start":19.734,"end":24.614,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,19.734],[1,21.071],[2,21.397],[3,21.488],[4,21.735],[5,23.155],[6,23.389],[7,23.493],[8,23.754],[9,23.91],[10,24.001],[11,24.327]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes! Don't touch it!","vi":"Có! Đừng chạm vào!","ipa":["jɛs","doʊnt","tʌtʃ","ɪt"],"start":25.404,"end":27.614,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,25.404],[1,26.829],[2,27.115],[3,27.415]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Sorry. OK, you're injured, but you're going to be OK.","vi":"Xin lỗi. Được rồi, cậu bị thương, nhưng cậu sẽ ổn thôi.","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","oʊˈkeɪ","jʊɹ","ˈɪndʒɚd","bʌt","jʊɹ","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","bi","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":28.404,"end":32.734,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,28.404],[1,29.949],[2,30.613],[3,30.743],[4,31.381],[5,31.55],[6,31.694],[7,31.941],[8,32.032],[9,32.214]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"How can we get down? I can't walk in this fog.","vi":"Làm sao mình xuống được đây? Tớ không đi nổi trong sương mù thế này.","ipa":["haʊ","kæn","wi","ɡɛt","daʊn","aɪ","kænt","wɔk","ɪn","ðɪs","fɑɡ"],"start":33.524,"end":36.994,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,33.524],[1,33.647],[2,33.804],[3,33.908],[4,34.103],[5,35.446],[6,35.629],[7,35.941],[8,36.254],[9,36.345],[10,36.553]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"We're not going down. It's too dangerous. We'll wait here, behind this rock.","vi":"Mình không xuống. Nguy hiểm lắm. Mình sẽ đợi ở đây, sau tảng đá này.","ipa":["wiɹ","nɑt","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","daʊn","ɪts","tu","ˈdeɪndʒɚəs","wil","weɪt","hiɹ","bɪˈhaɪnd","ðɪs","ɹɑk"],"start":37.784,"end":44.154,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,37.784],[1,37.914],[2,38.175],[3,38.474],[4,39.87],[5,40.156],[6,40.39],[7,42.044],[8,42.357],[9,42.578],[10,43.073],[11,43.489],[12,43.711]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I'm so cold. I can't stop shaking.","vi":"Tớ lạnh quá. Tớ không ngừng run được.","ipa":["aɪm","soʊ","koʊld","aɪ","kænt","stɑp","ˈʃeɪkɪŋ"],"start":44.944,"end":48.424,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,44.944],[1,45.087],[2,45.439],[3,46.939],[4,47.121],[5,47.485],[6,47.837]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Put my jacket on. Try to keep your hands inside. We need to keep you warm.","vi":"Mặc áo khoác của tớ vào. Cố giữ tay ở bên trong nhé. Mình phải giữ ấm cho cậu.","ipa":["pʊt","maɪ","ˈdʒækət","ɑn","tɹaɪ","tu","kip","jɔɹ","hændz","ˌɪnˈsaɪd","wi","nid","tu","kip","ju","wɔɹm"],"start":49.214,"end":55.364,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,49.214],[1,49.37],[2,49.553],[3,49.995],[4,51.274],[5,51.573],[6,51.677],[7,51.925],[8,52.068],[9,52.38],[10,53.956],[11,54.164],[12,54.399],[13,54.503],[14,54.75],[15,54.906]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Did you call for help?","vi":"Cậu gọi cứu hộ chưa?","ipa":["dɪd","ju","kɔl","fɔɹ","hɛlp"],"start":56.154,"end":57.214,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,56.154],[1,56.245],[2,56.376],[3,56.688],[4,56.87]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Yes. The rescue team knows where we are. Help is on the way.","vi":"Rồi. Đội cứu hộ biết mình ở đâu. Họ đang đến.","ipa":["jɛs","ðə","ˈɹɛskju","tim","noʊz","wɛɹ","wi","ɑɹ","hɛlp","ɪz","ɑn","ðə","weɪ"],"start":58.004,"end":63.554,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,58.004],[1,59.491],[2,59.686],[3,60.142],[4,60.454],[5,60.754],[6,60.962],[7,61.131],[8,62.407],[9,62.746],[10,62.876],[11,63.032],[12,63.137]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"How long will it take?","vi":"Mất bao lâu nữa?","ipa":["haʊ","lɔŋ","wɪl","ɪt","teɪk"],"start":64.344,"end":65.464,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,64.344],[1,64.454],[2,64.78],[3,64.91],[4,65.027]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"A few hours, maybe. But they'll find us. I promise.","vi":"Có lẽ vài tiếng. Nhưng họ sẽ tìm thấy mình. Tớ hứa.","ipa":["ə","fju","ˈaʊɚz","ˈmeɪbi","bʌt","ðeɪl","faɪnd","ʌs","aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs"],"start":66.254,"end":71.594,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,66.254],[1,66.322],[2,66.583],[3,67.221],[4,68.642],[5,68.824],[6,69.046],[7,69.384],[8,70.699],[9,70.895]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I feel so tired. I just want to sleep.","vi":"Tớ mệt quá. Tớ chỉ muốn ngủ thôi.","ipa":["aɪ","fil","soʊ","ˈtaɪɚd","aɪ","dʒʌst","wɑnt","tu","slip"],"start":72.384,"end":75.844,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,72.384],[1,72.478],[2,72.778],[3,73.09],[4,74.642],[5,74.811],[6,75.098],[7,75.267],[8,75.345]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"No, Tom. You need to stay awake. Keep talking to me. Tell me about your holiday plans.","vi":"Không được, Tom. Cậu phải thức. Cứ nói chuyện với tớ đi. Kể tớ nghe kế hoạch kỳ nghỉ của cậu.","ipa":["noʊ","tɑm","ju","nid","tu","steɪ","əˈweɪk","kip","ˈtɔkɪŋ","tu","mi","tɛl","mi","əˈbaʊt","jɔɹ","ˈhɑləˌdeɪ","plænz"],"start":76.634,"end":84.794,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,76.634],[1,77.181],[2,78.628],[3,78.85],[4,79.071],[5,79.149],[6,79.423],[7,80.881],[8,81.181],[9,81.571],[10,81.688],[11,82.912],[12,83.199],[13,83.355],[14,83.641],[15,83.785],[16,84.188]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"My holiday? Somewhere warm. Definitely somewhere warm.","vi":"Kỳ nghỉ của tớ á? Chỗ nào ấm áp. Chắc chắn là chỗ nào đó ấm áp.","ipa":["maɪ","ˈhɑləˌdeɪ","ˈsʌmˌwɛɹ","wɔɹm","ˈdɛfənətli","ˈsʌmˌwɛɹ","wɔɹm"],"start":85.584,"end":90.824,"expression":"happy","react":{"nadia":"happy"},"timing":[[0,85.584],[1,85.73],[2,87.295],[3,87.894],[4,89.287],[5,89.86],[6,90.355]]}],"words":[{"id":"calm","en":"calm","ipa":"kɑm","vi":"bình tĩnh; yên lặng; làm dịu; sự yên tĩnh","level":2},{"id":"hurt","en":"hurt","ipa":"hɝt","vi":"làm đau; bị thương; đau","level":0},{"id":"warm","en":"warm","ipa":"wɔɹm","vi":"ấm, ấm áp; làm ấm","level":0},{"id":"injured","en":"injured","ipa":"ˈɪndʒɚd","vi":"bị thương","level":3},{"id":"rescue","en":"rescue","ipa":"ˈɹɛskju","vi":"giải cứu; cứu; sự cứu hộ","level":2},{"id":"awake","en":"awake","ipa":"əˈweɪk","vi":"thức; tỉnh giấc","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Trấn an người khác trong tình huống khẩn cấp","pattern":"Stay calm. · Don't move. · You're going to be OK. · Help is on the way. · Can you feel…? · Try to… · Keep talking to me.","explain":"Trong khủng hoảng, dùng câu mệnh lệnh ngắn, rõ: \"Don't move.\", \"Stay still.\". Trấn an bằng tương lai gần: \"You're going to be OK.\", \"Help is on the way.\" Hỏi tình trạng: \"Can you feel your toes?\", \"Does it hurt when…?\". Giữ liên lạc: \"Keep talking to me.\"","keys":["stay calm","don't move","you're going to be ok","help is on the way","can you feel","keep talking to me"],"lines":[1,7,13,17]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-fog-on-the-mountain.mp3","v":"9e96d9a9e4","duration":91.92,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}